  "summary": "Bind the Small Shop object-event fixture and its research experiment.",
  "why": "The object-event path needed one runnable case that is not the state-version fixture. small_shop_fulfilment_object_event_v1 supplies retained warehouse source bytes, an object-event TBox, a mapping, a time context, one population plan and its oracle; the research experiment compiles, populates, admits, replays and queries them. The fixture is research evidence, not a Malleus rule: its ontology choices, mapping conveniences and query shapes stay research-local and bind nothing in Core beyond the profile identity it declares."
